rule check_result_1 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
the check result is true if
    it is not the case that
        it is not the case that the years owner occupied of the situation is a number
        or the years owner occupied of the situation is a number N
            and N < 0
            or the min years of the parameters is a number M
                and M < 0
                or it is not the case that the min years of the parameters is a third number
    and the years owner occupied of the situation is a number K
    and the min years of the parameters is a number P
    and K >= P.

rule check_result_2 with provenance the model at decision checkResult:
